  "testament": "old",
  "chapter": 11,
  "sortOrder": 1011,
  "verseCount": 32,
  "aliases": [
    "Gen",
    "Ge",
    "Gn"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "And the whole earth was of one language, and of one speech.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "And it came to pass, as they journeyed from the east, that they found a plain in the land of Shinar; and they dwelt there.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "And they said one to another, Go to, let us make brick, and burn them thoroughly. And they had brick for stone, and slime had they for morter.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "And they said, Go to, let us build us a city and a tower, whose top may reach unto heaven; and let us make us a name, lest we be scattered abroad upon the face of the whole earth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "And the LORD came down to see the city and the tower, which the children of men builded.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "And the LORD said, Behold, the people is one, and they have all one language; and this they begin to do: and now nothing will be restrained from them, which they have imagined to do.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "Go to, let us go down, and there confound their language, that they may not understand one another’s speech.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "So the LORD scattered them abroad from thence upon the face of all the earth: and they left off to build the city.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "Therefore is the name of it called Babel; because the LORD did there confound the language of all the earth: and from thence did the LORD scatter them abroad upon the face of all the earth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "These are the generations of Shem: Shem was an hundred years old, and begat Arphaxad two years after the flood:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "And Shem lived after he begat Arphaxad five hundred years, and begat sons and daughters.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "And Arphaxad lived five and thirty years, and begat Salah:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "And Arphaxad lived after he begat Salah four hundred and three years, and begat sons and daughters.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "And Salah lived thirty years, and begat Eber:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "And Salah lived after he begat Eber four hundred and three years, and begat sons and daughters.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "And Eber lived four and thirty years, and begat Peleg:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "And Eber lived after he begat Peleg four hundred and thirty years, and begat sons and daughters.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "And Peleg lived thirty years, and begat Reu:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "And Peleg lived after he begat Reu two hundred and nine years, and begat sons and daughters.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "And Reu lived two and thirty years, and begat Serug:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "And Reu lived after he begat Serug two hundred and seven years, and begat sons and daughters.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "And Serug lived thirty years, and begat Nahor:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "And Serug lived after he begat Nahor two hundred years, and begat sons and daughters.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "And Nahor lived nine and twenty years, and begat Terah:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:24"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-025",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 25,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:25",
      "numberLabel": "25",
      "text": "And Nahor lived after he begat Terah an hundred and nineteen years, and begat sons and daughters.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:25",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:25"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-026",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 26,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:26",
      "numberLabel": "26",
      "text": "And Terah lived seventy years, and begat Abram, Nahor, and Haran.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:26",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:26"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-027",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 27,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:27",
      "numberLabel": "27",
      "text": "Now these are the generations of Terah: Terah begat Abram, Nahor, and Haran; and Haran begat Lot.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:27",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:27"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-028",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 28,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:28",
      "numberLabel": "28",
      "text": "And Haran died before his father Terah in the land of his nativity, in Ur of the Chaldees.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:28",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:28"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-029",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 29,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:29",
      "numberLabel": "29",
      "text": "And Abram and Nahor took them wives: the name of Abram’s wife was Sarai; and the name of Nahor’s wife, Milcah, the daughter of Haran, the father of Milcah, and the father of Iscah.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:29",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:29"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-030",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 30,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:30",
      "numberLabel": "30",
      "text": "But Sarai was barren; she had no child.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:30",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:30"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-031",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 31,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:31",
      "numberLabel": "31",
      "text": "And Terah took Abram his son, and Lot the son of Haran his son’s son, and Sarai his daughter in law, his son Abram’s wife; and they went forth with them from Ur of the Chaldees, to go into the land of Canaan; and they came unto Haran, and dwelt there.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:31",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-032",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 32,
      "verseId": "kjv:genesis:11:32",
      "numberLabel": "32",
      "text": "And the days of Terah were two hundred and five years: and Terah died in Haran.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Genesis 11:32",
        "verseKey": "kjv:genesis:11:32"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
